flowchart TD
    User([Reporter]) --> OpenForm[Open Submission Portal]
    OpenForm --> InputID[Enter or Auto-Generate Report ID]
    InputID --> LiveDFA[Client & Server Run DFA Simulation]
    LiveDFA --> CheckValid{DFA Accepted & Regex Match?}
    
    CheckValid --No--> ShowDFAError[Display State Transition Trap Reason]
    ShowDFAError --> FixID[Correction Required by User]
    FixID --> InputID
    
    CheckValid --Yes--> EnterDetails[Enter Signal ID, Zone, Location, Contact]
    EnterDetails --> EnterDesc[Type Fault Description]
    EnterDesc --> NLPPreview[Real-Time Keyword Classification Preview]
    NLPPreview --> SuggestPrio[Auto-Suggest Priority & Category]
    SuggestPrio --> ReviewSubmit[User Reviews and Submits Form]
    
    ReviewSubmit --> POSTAPI[POST /api/reports/submit]
    POSTAPI --> ValidateAll[Full Backend Schema Validation]
    ValidateAll --> SaveDB[Insert Report with Status 'SUBMITTED']
    SaveDB --> TriggerDispatch[Execute Dispatch Algorithm]
    TriggerDispatch --> ResponseJSON[Return Dispatch Decision & Assignment]
    ResponseJSON --> ShowConfirmation[Display Success Modal to Reporter]
